## 4. Architectural Matrix: Comparing Chunking Strategies

| Strategy | Granularity | Computational Complexity | Impact on Precision | Impact on Recall | Primary Downside |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Fixed-Size** | Arbitrary | Very Low | Low (High Noise) | High | Severs context mid-sentence |
| **Sentence-Based** | Atomic | Low | High | Low (Context Missing) | Lacks macro-context |
| **Paragraph-Based**| Structural | Low | Medium-High | Medium | Highly irregular chunk sizes |
| **Semantic** | Conceptual | Medium-High | Very High | High | High embedding compute costs |
| **Agentic** | Propositional| Very High | Maximum | High | Extreme token cost & latency |

